# ARCHITECT PROTOCOL — BOSS DOES NOT IMPLEMENT

ARCHITECT → BOSS → SUPERVISOR → MANAGER → WORKER → RELEASE_READY

**Default:** implement every listed feature. Keep going. Find a way. Ship the **entire product** (minimum viable, complete). Do not trim docs to pass audit.

**Override:** only when Architect **explicitly says otherwise** in writing.

Hard gate: RELEASE_READY (whole product, public release) or BLOCKED only.

See `.cursor/rules/architect-protocol.mdc`
